  "description": "YIPQIB crystallizes in the trigonal crystal system with space group P -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H101 Dy4 N3 Ni3 O31,11(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.387-4.424 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.68-144.86°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C78H123Dy4N3Ni3O42. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
